        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-401, Curved Branch Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThere is something so chic and beautiful about bringing rustic elements into a space. This beautiful Branch Cabinet Pull made by RK International is a great way to add a natural element to any space. It can be hung vertical or horizontal for two different looks. The CP-401 Curved Branch Cabinet Door Pull is available in 6 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/branch-cabinet-door-knob-rk-international-ck-201\"><b>CK-201 Branch Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-401 Twig Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/norton-closer-arms.jpg?v=1704354564\" width=\"599\" height=\"123\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
